{
  "sn36.11:0.1": "Linked Discourses 36.11 ",
  "sn36.11:0.2": "2. In Private ",
  "sn36.11:0.3": "In Private ",
  "sn36.11:1.1": "Then a mendicant went up to the Buddha, bowed, sat down to one side, and said to him: ",
  "sn36.11:1.2": "“Just now, sir, as I was in private retreat this thought came to mind. ",
  "sn36.11:1.3": "The Buddha has spoken of three feelings. ",
  "sn36.11:1.4": "Pleasant, painful, and neutral feeling. ",
  "sn36.11:1.5": "These are the three feelings the Buddha has spoken of. ",
  "sn36.11:1.6": "But the Buddha has also said: ",
  "sn36.11:1.7": "‘Suffering includes whatever is felt.’ ",
  "sn36.11:1.8": "What was the Buddha referring to when he said this?” ",
  "sn36.11:1.9": "",
  "sn36.11:2.1": "“Good, good, mendicant! ",
  "sn36.11:2.2": "I have spoken of these three feelings. ",
  "sn36.11:2.3": "Pleasant, painful, and neutral feeling. ",
  "sn36.11:2.4": "These are the three feelings I have spoken of. ",
  "sn36.11:2.5": "But I have also said: ",
  "sn36.11:2.6": "‘Suffering includes whatever is felt.’ ",
  "sn36.11:2.7": "When I said this I was referring to the impermanence of conditions, to the fact that conditions are ",
  "sn36.11:2.8": "",
  "sn36.11:2.9": "liable to end, ",
  "sn36.11:2.10": "vanish, ",
  "sn36.11:2.11": "fade away, ",
  "sn36.11:2.12": "cease, ",
  "sn36.11:2.13": "and perish. ",
  "sn36.11:2.14": "",
  "sn36.11:2.15": "But I have also explained the progressive cessation of activities. ",
  "sn36.11:2.16": "For someone who has attained the 